  "text": "Quantitative Variable Quantitative Variable Variables that are measured on a numeric or quantitative scale. Ordinal , interval and ratio scales are quantitative. A country’s population, a person’s shoe size, or a car’s speed are all quantitative variables. Variables that are not quantitative are known as qualitative variables .",
